'''Pack Like a Yak''' is a [[Combat Achievements/Grandmaster|grandmaster combat achievement]] which requires the player to complete a [[Theatre of Blood: Hard Mode]] raid within the challenge time, without anyone dying and without buying anything from the [[Chest (Theatre of Blood)|supply chest]].

==Strategy==
A [[stamina potion]] may be helpful to bring for both the [[Nylocas]] room and [[Verzik]]'s fight. Only 1-2 players need to bring one with [[Boost Potion Share]] if they share the doses before the Nylocas room and/or before Verzik's web attack.

Players should try to only use supplies at the Nylocas and Verzik's fight. Prayer potions might be needed at the Maiden, Bloat and [[Sotetseg]] if necessary, but do not waste too much as the supplies will be needed for Verzik. Plan on saving at least 3 [[Saradomin brew|Saradomin brews]] and 3 [[Super restore|Super restores]] for Verzik's fight in case of mistakes, meaning you should try to bring at least 4 brews and 4 restores into the raid to be safe.

* Avoid extra hits at bloat if they would result in tanking flies or stomps.
* Bring an extra brew and hard food for emergencies and to heal before [[Nylocas Vasilias]] or during the waves
* Time Sotetseg's death ball with his shadow maze attack to remove the need to heal off its damage or camp low hitpoints.

